--- !u!1001 &39650993
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 0}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 5104073181026472674, guid: fbe5dc7bb912fbb4189bfbf716073ae1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: NPC_Ambientalin
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5415706260632634918, guid: fbe5dc7bb912fbb4189bfbf716073ae1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogos.Array.size
      value: 7
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5415706260632634918, guid: fbe5dc7bb912fbb4189bfbf716073ae1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogos.Array.data[0].texto
      value: "\xA1Espera! No te acerques a\n esos charcos ni a ese\n mont\xF3n de
        desperdicios.\n Podr\xEDas enfermarte."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5415706260632634918, guid: fbe5dc7bb912fbb4189bfbf716073ae1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogos.Array.data[1].texto
      value: "\xBFPor qu\xE9? Vi varios roedores\n e insectos rondando cerca\n de
        las aguas negras...\r\n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5415706260632634918, guid: fbe5dc7bb912fbb4189bfbf716073ae1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogos.Array.data[2].texto
      value: "Precisamente. El estancamiento de\n aguas sucias y la basura\n descompuesta
        crean el ecosistema\n perfecto para la proliferaci\xF3n\n de plagas como
        ratas y mosquitos.\r\n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5415706260632634918, guid: fbe5dc7bb912fbb4189bfbf716073ae1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogos.Array.data[3].texto
      value: "Me imagino que eso es muy\n peligroso para las familias\n que viven
        cerca.\r\n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5415706260632634918, guid: fbe5dc7bb912fbb4189bfbf716073ae1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogos.Array.data[4].texto
      value: "Lo es. Esos roedores y bacterias\n transmiten infecciones graves\n
        y virus que afectan directamente\n la salud p\xFAblica, especialmente a \nlos
        ni\xF1os y adultos mayores. \r\n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5415706260632634918, guid: fbe5dc7bb912fbb4189bfbf716073ae1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogos.Array.data[5].texto
      value: "Las aguas negras contienen\n agentes pat\xF3genos que\n contaminan
        todo lo que tocan."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5415706260632634918, guid: fbe5dc7bb912fbb4189bfbf716073ae1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogos.Array.data[6].texto
      value: "   Es una emergencia de salud.\n \xA1Necesitamos sanear el lugar\n
        antes de que m\xE1s gente enferme! "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5415706260632634918, guid: fbe5dc7bb912fbb4189bfbf716073ae1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogos.Array.data[5].esJugador
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5415706260632634918, guid: fbe5dc7bb912fbb4189bfbf716073ae1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogos.Array.data[6].esJugador
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7392805380021571251, guid: fbe5dc7bb912fbb4189bfbf716073ae1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_LocalPosition.x
      value: -20
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7392805380021571251, guid: fbe5dc7bb912fbb4189bfbf716073ae1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_LocalPosition.y
      value: -6.1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7392805380021571251, guid: fbe5dc7bb912fbb4189bfbf716073ae1, type: 3}
